CurrentMusic for Windows 2.0\par\par
Native Windows music client for the CurrentMusic service.\par\par
CurrentMusic is distributed under the MIT License. The installed program includes LICENSE.txt and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt. Access to music depends on the service and your account.\par\par
The application uses Windows Credential Manager for the session token and stores preferences in the local user profile. Uninstall removes the program and preserves user data. Sign out in CurrentMusic to remove the saved session.\par\par
Project and service: https://music.20110208.xyz\par
